<title>PHILIPPINES: Purefoods says 1997 Q1 net 19.3 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Purefoods says 1997 Q1 net 19.3 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Purefoods Corp said on Tuesday it posted a net income of 19.3 million pesos for the first quarter of the year from a net loss of 108 million pesos in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
